      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Exceptional Waterfront Development Opportunity – Quay Village, Ballina\r\n\r\nOccupying one of the finest positions in Quay Village, this exceptional property enjoys uninterrupted panoramic views over the renowned River Moy, with Belleek Woods providing a stunning natural backdrop.\r\n\r\nSituated in one of Ballina's most sought-after residential locations, the property comprises a terraced house on a substantial site with the benefit of full planning permission for an architecturally designed contemporary residence by the award-winning architects McGarry Moon.\r\n\r\nThe approved design has been carefully planned to maximise the spectacular river views, featuring an expansive first-floor living area with vaulted ceilings opening onto a generous riverside terrace. The property also benefits from off-street parking for up to four cars, together with an internal courtyard carport.\r\n\r\nPlanning Permission Includes\r\nGround Floor: 157 sq.m\r\nFirst Floor: 206 sq.m\r\nTotal Floor Area: 363 sq.m (3,907 sq.ft)\r\nFirst Floor Terrace: 55 sq.m\r\nSite Area: 1,026 sq.m\r\nExisting Outbuildings: 51.5 sq.m\r\nPrime Waterfront Location\r\n\r\nThe property is ideally positioned within a short stroll of:\r\n\r\nThe Quay Marina and its leisure boating facilities\r\nThe Ice House Hotel\r\nLocal bars and restaurants\r\nQuay National School\r\nBallina Rugby Club\r\n\r\nThe popular seaside resort of Enniscrone is also just a short drive away.\r\n\r\nOutstanding Development Potential\r\n\r\nWith one of the largest frontages available in Quay Village, this unique property offers exceptional flexibility. Subject to the necessary planning permission, the extensive frontage may provide the opportunity for the development of two homes.\r\n\r\nWhether seeking to create a spectacular family residence, an exclusive holiday home, or an investment in one of Ballina's most desirable waterfront locations, this property presents a rare opportunity.\r\n\r\nProspective purchasers may choose to:\r\n\r\nRedevelop the existing bungalow and potentially avail of Government refurbishment grants (subject to eligibility and scheme terms), or\r\nConstruct the approved architect-designed residence, or alternatively pursue a revised design, subject to obtaining the necessary planning permission.\r\n\r\nProperties with this combination of location, frontage, planning approval and unrivalled River Moy views rarely come to the market, making this a truly outstanding opportunity."
      },
